  "details": "Description\n\nMy audio is always cutting out. This happens when I lag, have my browser or other apps open, around a lot of people, in big laggy worlds or when my headset turns off for a while from being ark and to come back to no audio. This happens a LOT and should be fixed very soon\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nTemporarily turning on and off headset. Exiting the VRChat app and going back in. Resetting headset. Avoiding opening browser / other apps\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Audio\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: Quest (platform: Android - Quest, store: Oculus, headset: Oculus Quest 2)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.2-1948-2b94e366a5-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
